# Contact Form Configuration (Optional)
# In development, if credentials are not set, submissions are saved locally to messages.txt.

# Option 1: Resend API Key (Recommended for Vercel/serverless)
RESEND_API_KEY=your_resend_api_key

# Option 2: Gmail SMTP App Password (Google Account > Security > App Passwords)
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your_gmail_app_password

# Optional: Recipient Email Override (defaults to email in src/lib/site.ts)
CONTACT_EMAIL=your_email@example.com

# Analytics Configuration (Optional)
# If omitted, Google Analytics is disabled with zero errors or bundle overhead.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=your_google_analytics_id
